# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in SOWGUW.DAT on disc 1. This chapter's kanji and marks,
# 0x0100-0x01E3, in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high byte
# first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter shares).
